# This directory is for optional component-specific style customization
# 
# You can create JSON files here to customize MORDOC component styles:
# - main.json - Global colors, fonts, and design tokens
# - header.json - Header component customization
# - sidenav.json - Side navigation customization
# - card.json - Card component customization
# - codeblock.json - Code block syntax highlighting
# ... and more
#
# See documentation for available MORDOC variables for each component

